Complete corresponding source for the bundled FFmpeg runtime
============================================================

This package bundles the Tesserafin FFmpeg runtime, build revision
@F0_BUILD_REVISION@. That runtime is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later: it is built from
FFmpeg with --enable-gpl and --enable-version3, and it statically links a number
of GPL, LGPL and permissively licensed components.

The complete corresponding source for it — the preferred form for modification of
everything statically linked into the binaries, plus the exact build scripts and
the instructions needed to rebuild them — is NOT inside this package. It is
approximately 232 MB, it is identical for every architecture and for all three
package formats, and duplicating it six times would only invite the copies to
diverge.

It is distributed as a single archive ALONGSIDE this package, in the same place
this package was obtained from:

  filename : @F0_SOURCE_ARCHIVE@
  SHA-256  : @F0_SOURCE_SHA256@

The same filename and digest are recorded in the architecture checksum manifest
(SHA256SUMS-<architecture>.txt) and in the provenance manifest of every artifact
(<artifact>.provenance.json), so the archive can be identified without trusting
this file alone.

The runtime also records its own source baseline: see
/usr/share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/SOURCE.json, which names this archive and its
digest, and /usr/share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/sbom.cdx.json, which enumerates every
component with its version, licence and source location.

Upstream
--------

The FFmpeg tree is @F0_UPSTREAM_REPOSITORY@ at commit
@F0_UPSTREAM_COMMIT@. The archive contains that tree, every dependency source,
and the build scripts, all at the exact revisions the binaries were produced
from.

What this archive is NOT
------------------------

It is the corresponding source for the FFmpeg RUNTIME only. It does not contain
the Tesserafin server source or the Tesserafin Web source, and it does not claim
to. Those are separate works with their own repositories and their own licences:

  server : https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin.git
           at commit @SERVER_COMMIT@, GPL-2.0-or-later
  web    : https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin-web.git
           at commit @WEB_VCS_REF@

Both are public at the commits named above; see
/usr/share/doc/tesserafin-server/copyright for the full component and licence
breakdown of this package.
